throw it on a pile for the planting game.

9
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:34,180
Now, them cane ain't gonna jump up and bite you.

10
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:35,280
Don't shy back.

11
00:01:35,280 --> 00:07:53,000
Rocher, boys, Rocher.

12
00:07:53,000 --> 00:08:06,460
custom. I wonder what you'll do without me. I won't stay idle. Good money. You don't have to

13
